From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yuichi Kusakabe <yuichi_kusakabe@jp.honda>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 00:47:54 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] drm/vc4: let an overlay plane go under the primary plane

The primary plane had an immutable zpos of 0 and the overlays a range of
1..17, so no plane could be put under the primary. weston uses an
underlay plane only when the plane's zpos_min is below the primary's, so
a video under a translucent UI (a WebView) never got a plane and was
composited on the GPU. Give the primary a zpos of 1 (range 1..17) and
let the overlays go down to 0. With no zpos set the order is unchanged:
equal zpos sort by plane id, and the primary is created before the
overlays.

The primary's maximum is written as 16 + 1 because
VC4_NUM_OVERLAY_PLANES is defined after this function in vc4_plane.c.

Assisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Yuichi Kusakabe <yuichi_kusakabe@jp.honda>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/vc4/vc4_plane.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/vc4/vc4_plane.c
@@ -2803,8 +2803,15 @@
 
 	drm_plane_create_chroma_siting_properties(plane, 0, 0);
 
+	/*
+	 * The primary sits at zpos 1 (range 1..17) and the overlays may go down to 0,
+	 * so a compositor can put a plane under the primary: weston only uses an
+	 * underlay plane whose zpos_min is below the primary zpos_min. With no zpos
+	 * set the order is unchanged: equal zpos sort by plane id, and the primary is
+	 * created before the overlays.
+	 */
 	if (type == DRM_PLANE_TYPE_PRIMARY)
-		drm_plane_create_zpos_immutable_property(plane, 0);
+		drm_plane_create_zpos_property(plane, 1, 1, 16 + 1);
 
 	return plane;
 }
@@ -2852,7 +2859,7 @@
 		/* Create zpos property. Max of all the overlays + 1 primary +
 		 * 1 cursor plane on a crtc.
 		 */
-		drm_plane_create_zpos_property(plane, i + 1, 1,
+		drm_plane_create_zpos_property(plane, i + 1, 0,
 					       VC4_NUM_OVERLAY_PLANES + 1);
 	}
 
@@ -2867,7 +2874,7 @@
 		/* Create zpos property. Max of all the overlays + 1 primary +
 		 * 1 cursor plane on a crtc.
 		 */
-		drm_plane_create_zpos_property(plane, i + 1, 1,
+		drm_plane_create_zpos_property(plane, i + 1, 0,
 					       VC4_NUM_OVERLAY_PLANES + 1);
 	}
 
